    },
    "Capsule" : {
      "comment" : "Item form or color name: the text “Capsule”."
    },
    "Change %@" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label of the record circle of a recorded dose. The placeholder is the item name. Change means to correct a record, for example Change Vitamin D."
    },
    "Change Time…" : {
      "comment" : "Menu item, button, and swipe action that open a sheet to set the time when a dose was taken. The ellipsis means that a sheet follows."
